 re inside the path\, 61 km from its centre line: the star vanishes for up 
 to 1.8 s.\nClosest approach 19:58:46 IST\, give or take 2 s. The star is 2
 0° up in the S · dark sky.\nIt fades 3.5 magnitudes for up to 8.3 s on t
 he centre line\, and the path is 85 km wide\, give or take 16 km.\nThe map
 \, the finder chart and the path as KML: https://occult.alokm.com/asteroid
 ?e=2027-08-12-795-fini-257280
